### --- Bundle prerequisites (downloaded by CI, embedded into the offline installer) --- ###
# Fetched at build time by the "Download bundle prerequisites" CI step — never commit them.
desktop/installer/Bundle/dotnet-runtime-*.exe
desktop/installer/Bundle/winfsp-*.msi

